    "share_of_gini_from_zero_service": 0.8396277647801628,
    "text": "Service is unequally spread across residents (frequency-weighted accessibility Gini 0.903, descriptive and in-sample), but 75.8% of residents have no service at all and that share alone is 84% of the Gini (G = z + (1 - z) * G_served, G_served = 0.599 among served residents). The plan's effect on equity is not estimable: no before-state exists. Consolidation suppresses 32 alternative via-routings on 20 corridors; for 31 of them a proxy (400 m straight-line disc around one geocoded via-place vs the network catchment) puts 13,087 residents outside the plan network, and the figure ranges 3,822 to 13,087 across 8 geometry x pin-screen variants. It is neither an upper nor a lower bound.",
